/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (The dataset used in this project contains information related to borrowers and their loan details. It includes features such as age, income, home ownership, loan amount, loan interest rate, loan grade, and credit history length. The target variable is loan status, which indicates whether a borrower is likely to default or not default on a loan.)
